        "original_id": "39dd9545-3856-5106-97f9-8879e1664f79",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Josh Stolberg, Jack Black, Todd Phillips, Alexandre Aja, Laura Ziskin\n- Films: Man-Witch, Piranha 3D, House on Sorority Row, The Life Coach, Piranha\n- Books: The Spellman Files, The Candy Shop Wars\n\nFacts:\n- In 2005, Josh Stolberg directed the mockumentary film The Life Coach.\n- In 2010, Piranha 3D was released as an American 3D horror comedy film and as a loose remake of the 1978 film Piranha.\n- Josh Stolberg co-wrote the script for Man-Witch, which starred Jack Black and was directed by Todd Phillips.\n- Josh Stolberg co-wrote the remake of Piranha 3D, which was directed by Alexandre Aja.\n- Josh Stolberg co-wrote the remake of House on Sorority Row.\n- Josh Stolberg co-wrote the book adaptation of The Spellman Files, which was produced by Laura Ziskin.\n- Josh Stolberg co-wrote the book adaptation of The Candy Shop Wars.",
